invariant: INV-45
file: sha3.c
catches: sha3_equiv_test
reason: one lane of chi takes its two neighbours in the other order. The
  equivalence test runs the permutation on each of the 1,600 states
  with one bit set and on random states, and requires the reference's
  state.

--- old
    a[7] = b7 ^ (~b8 & b9);
--- new
    a[7] = b7 ^ (~b9 & b8);
